rule (modulo E) Accept_123[no_derivcheck]:
   [
   !Pk( 's1', pk(skA) ), !Pk( 's2', pk(skB) ), !Pk( 's3', pk(skC) ),
   In( <K, v, sign(<K, v, 's1'>, skA), sign(<K, v, 's2'>, skB), 
